[TITLE]
SIM-15: pressure-driven demand with a pressure exponent of 0
EN_setdemandmodel rejects an exponent of 0; the input file should too.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     500       ; gpm
 J2   0     500

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   30

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    6     100    0      Open
 P2  J1  J2  1000    6     100    0      Open

[OPTIONS]
 Units              GPM
 Headloss           H-W
 Demand Model       PDA
 Minimum Pressure   0
 Required Pressure  10
 Pressure Exponent  0     ; invalid: demand = full x (p / 10)^0

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[END]
